        <mxCell id="rules" value="KEY RULES&#10;Rescheduling is restricted by the existing time and ownership rules; a stale schedule must be refreshed.&#10;A slot change preserves the consultation identity and respects current availability.&#10;Custom jobs, accepted orders and held payments use their own guards; cancelling a meeting is not an automatic refund." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#273142;fontFamily=Montserrat;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
